 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile            |   2 +
 .../ipq-wifi/files/board-mojo_c-130.qca9984   | Bin 0 -> 24308 bytes
 .../ipq806x/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network |   3 +-
